  "rounds": {
    "1": {
      "note": "寵物 (cung2 mat6) means pet, and the verb <strong>養</strong> (joeng5) covers raising or keeping any animal. The diminutive suffix 仔 (zai2) attaches to many small animals: 狗仔 (gau2 zai2, puppy), 貓仔 (maau1 zai2, kitten), 兔仔 (tou3 zai2, rabbit — the standard form). Note <strong>牛肉</strong> (ngau4 juk6, beef) and <strong>豬肉</strong> (zyu1 juk6, pork) — same animal words plus 肉 (juk6, meat).",
